# ─── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required in production. Local development falls back to an embedded Postgres
# in .data/pg, which is fine for working but must never hold real statements
# you care about keeping.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host:5432/royalties

# ─── setlist.fm ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only needed by `npm run fetch:setlistfm`. Free key:
# https://www.setlist.fm/settings/api
# SETLISTFM_API_KEY=

# ─── Claim window ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Days after a performance during which it can still be submitted to a PRO.
# ASCAP OnStage and BMI Live have each changed this; confirm against their
# current rules rather than trusting the default.
# CLAIM_WINDOW_DAYS=180

# ─── Paths ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PGLITE_DIR=.data/pg
